    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The playable demo is now live!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you\u2019ll give it a try and let me know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invite link is available in the game's main menu and on the right sidebar of this Steam page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in early development, there are undoubtedly rough edges and bugs to be found. I\u2019d greatly appreciate your feedback and bug reports in the Steam Community forums or Discord. Your input will help me refine the demo and shape the official release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.poster.avif?t=1753249896\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.webm?t=1753249896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.mp4?t=1753249896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine and Position Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place buildings to <strong>automatically generate</strong> gold or combat units. Maximize efficiency by leveraging <strong>synergy bonuses</strong> based on placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/36473f298fd901ba5accd741d700bec0.avif?t=1753249896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automated Units and Intense Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a mighty human army by combining units with <strong>counterplay strategies</strong>. Watch your forces march into battle, overcoming enemies and destroying their core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/86eab3fea36429221a2860dadb7cd1fc.avif?t=1753249896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game-Changing Commander Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from commanders with unique <strong>active skills</strong>, <strong>passive traits</strong>, and four <strong>exclusive buildings</strong> to shape your strategy and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/de455116d528fecf5e17da70b9eeeb43.avif?t=1753249896\" width=800 height=764 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The playable demo is now live!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you\u2019ll give it a try and let me know what you think!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The invite link is available in the game's main menu and on the right sidebar of this Steam page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game is still in early development, there are undoubtedly rough edges and bugs to be found. I\u2019d greatly appreciate your feedback and bug reports in the Steam Community forums or Discord. Your input will help me refine the demo and shape the official release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.poster.avif?t=1753249896\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.webm?t=1753249896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/6d7fc98999451f17c9f5de50eb22ea3b.mp4?t=1753249896\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine and Position Buildings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place buildings to <strong>automatically generate</strong> gold or combat units. Maximize efficiency by leveraging <strong>synergy bonuses</strong> based on placement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/36473f298fd901ba5accd741d700bec0.avif?t=1753249896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Automated Units and Intense Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a mighty human army by combining units with <strong>counterplay strategies</strong>. Watch your forces march into battle, overcoming enemies and destroying their core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/86eab3fea36429221a2860dadb7cd1fc.avif?t=1753249896\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game-Changing Commander Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from commanders with unique <strong>active skills</strong>, <strong>passive traits</strong>, and four <strong>exclusive buildings</strong> to shape your strategy and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480990/extras/de455116d528fecf5e17da70b9eeeb43.avif?t=1753249896\" width=800 height=764 /></span></p>",
